00:02:19.056 --> 00:02:21.000
<v Host>It means a department store.

00:02:21.599 --> 00:02:30.768
<v Slow>このデパートで、10月12日から、日本のお米が試しに売られています。

00:02:31.568 --> 00:02:36.343
<v Host>Since October twelfth, Japanese rice has been sold here as a test.

00:02:36.943 --> 00:02:39.247
<v Vocab>試しに

00:02:39.647 --> 00:02:42.240
<v Host>It means as a trial, to try it out.

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:55.223
<v Slow>売っているのは、北海道の「ゆめぴりか」や新潟県の「コシヒカリ」など、6つの種類のお米です。

00:02:56.024 --> 00:03:01.496
<v Host>They are selling six kinds of rice, including famous brands from Hokkaido and Niigata.

00:03:02.096 --> 00:03:04.207
<v Vocab>種類

00:03:04.608 --> 00:03:06.743
<v Host>It means a kind or a type.

00:03:07.343 --> 00:03:14.639
<v Slow>お米は小さいパックに分けてあって、買いやすくなっています。

00:03:15.439 --> 00:03:19.568
<v Host>The rice is divided into small packs, so it is easy to buy.

00:03:20.168 --> 00:03:22.304
<v Vocab>分ける

00:03:22.704 --> 00:03:25.104
<v Host>It means to divide or split.

00:03:25.704 --> 00:03:27.888
<v Vocab>やすい

00:03:28.288 --> 00:03:31.144
<v Host>Added to a verb, it means easy to do.

00:03:31.743 --> 00:03:41.536
<v Slow>お店ではご飯を食べてみることができて、家族で来た人たちが味を比べていました。

00:03:42.336 --> 00:03:47.544
<v Host>In the store, people can try eating the rice, and families compared the taste.

00:03:48.144 --> 00:03:50.015
<v Vocab>味

00:03:50.415 --> 00:03:52.599
<v Host>It means taste or flavor.

00:03:53.199 --> 00:03:55.455
<v Vocab>比べる

00:03:55.855 --> 00:03:57.728
<v Host>It means to compare.

00:03:58.328 --> 00:04:04.448
