00:04:12.199 --> 00:04:14.120
<v Host>It means how to cook rice.

00:04:14.719 --> 00:04:16.807
<v Vocab>配る

00:04:17.208 --> 00:04:19.079
<v Host>It means to hand out.

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:30.384
<v Slow>ドイツでは日本の料理が人気ですが、レストランでは安い外国のお米を使うことが多いです。

00:04:31.184 --> 00:04:36.752
<v Host>Japanese food is popular in Germany, but restaurants often use cheap foreign rice.

00:04:37.351 --> 00:04:39.512
<v Vocab>人気

00:04:39.911 --> 00:04:42.815
<v Host>It means popular, or popularity.

00:04:43.415 --> 00:04:45.744
<v Vocab>外国

00:04:46.144 --> 00:04:48.279
