00:05:17.079 --> 00:05:18.951
<v Host>It means export.

00:05:19.552 --> 00:05:21.663
<v Vocab>増える

00:05:22.064 --> 00:05:23.935
<v Host>It means to increase.

00:05:24.536 --> 00:05:34.447
<v Slow>日本の人は、「ワインのように、場所によって違う味を知ってほしい」と話しています。

00:05:35.247 --> 00:05:41.872
<v Host>A Japanese official said: like wine, we want people to know the taste is different depending on the place.

00:05:42.471 --> 00:05:44.680
